  ("Y" 0.1177 0.1694 0.2481 0.3044 0.3044 0.0563 nil nil 0.0518 "AAAAAC+LiberationSans" 0.0600 nil nil 0)
  ("foreword" 0.4053 0.5938 0.1581 0.1922 0.1922 0.0341 nil 0.2991 0.1885 "AAAAAC+LiberationSans" 0.0364 nil nil 0)
  ("our brain has amazing abilities, but it did not come with an instruction" 0.1729 0.8482 0.2574 0.2739 0.2739 0.0165 0.00588 0.3353 0.0325 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("manual. You’ll find that manual in A Mind for Numbers. Whether you’re" 0.1729 0.8657 0.2792 0.2958 0.2958 0.0165 0.00588 0.3748 0.0765 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("a novice or an expert, you will find great new ways to improve your skills and" 0.1177 0.8741 0.3010 0.3176 0.3176 0.0165 0.00588 0.3159 0.0104 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("techniques for learning, especially related to math and science." 0.1177 0.7224 0.3229 0.3394 0.3394 0.0165 0.00588 0.2748 0.1009 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("Henri Poincaré was a nineteenth-century mathematician who once" 0.1577 0.7916 0.3447 0.3612 0.3612 0.0165 0.00588 0.3095 0.0548 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("described how he cracked a difficult mathematical problem that he had been" 0.1177 0.8482 0.3665 0.3830 0.3830 0.0165 0.00588 0.3124 0.0929 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("intensively working on for weeks without success. He took a vacation. As he" 0.1177 0.8528 0.3883 0.4048 0.4048 0.0165 0.00588 0.3203 0.1047 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("was getting on a bus in the south of France, the answer to the problem suddenly" 0.1177 0.8812 0.4101 0.4266 0.4266 0.0165 0.00588 0.3134 0.0362 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("came to him, unbidden, from a part of his brain that had continued to work on" 0.1177 0.8671 0.4320 0.4485 0.4485 0.0165 0.00588 0.3412 0.0505 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("the problem while he was enjoying his vacation. He knew he had the right" 0.1177 0.8265 0.4538 0.4703 0.4703 0.0165 0.00588 0.3216 0.0281 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("solution even though he did not write down the details until he later returned to" 0.1177 0.8753 0.4756 0.4921 0.4921 0.0165 0.00588 0.3070 0.0788 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("Paris." 0.1177 0.1729 0.4974 0.5139 0.5139 0.0165 nil 0.1934 0.0553 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("What worked for Poincaré can work for you too, as Barbara Oakley" 0.1577 0.8176 0.5192 0.5357 0.5357 0.0165 0.00588 0.3227 0.0512 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("explains in this insightful book. Surprisingly, your brain can also work on a" 0.1177 0.8505 0.5410 0.5576 0.5576 0.0165 0.00588 0.2852 0.0797 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("problem even while you are sleeping and are not aware of anything. But it does" 0.1177 0.8809 0.5628 0.5794 0.5794 0.0165 0.00588 0.3094 0.0818 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("this only if you concentrate on trying to solve the problem before falling" 0.1177 0.8200 0.5847 0.6012 0.6012 0.0165 0.00588 0.2986 0.0339 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("asleep. In the morning, as often as not, a fresh insight will pop to mind that can" 0.1177 0.8753 0.6065 0.6230 0.6230 0.0165 0.00588 0.3406 0.0659 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("help you solve the problem. The intense effort before a vacation or falling" 0.1177 0.8341 0.6283 0.6448 0.6448 0.0165 0.00588 0.2951 0.0412 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("asleep is important for priming your brain; otherwise it will work on some" 0.1177 0.8422 0.6501 0.6666 0.6666 0.0165 0.00588 0.3498 0.0600 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("other problem. There is nothing special about math or science in this regard—" 0.1177 0.8753 0.6720 0.6885 0.6885 0.0165 0.00588 0.3088 0.0490 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("your brain will work just as hard at solving social problems as on math and" 0.1177 0.8471 0.6938 0.7103 0.7103 0.0165 0.00588 0.3221 0.0443 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("science problems, if that is what has been on your mind recently." 0.1177 0.7400 0.7156 0.7321 0.7321 0.0165 0.00588 0.3158 0.0704 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("You will find many more insights and techniques about how to learn" 0.1577 0.8153 0.7374 0.7539 0.7539 0.0165 0.00588 0.3277 0.0388 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("effectively in this fascinating and timely book, which looks at learning as an" 0.1177 0.8518 0.7592 0.7758 0.7758 0.0165 0.00588 0.3018 0.1023 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("adventure rather than hard labor. You will see how you can fool yourself about" 0.1177 0.8783 0.7810 0.7976 0.7976 0.0165 0.00588 0.2835 0.0940 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("whether you actually know the material; you will find ways to hold your focus" 0.1177 0.8715 0.8028 0.8194 0.8194 0.0165 0.00588 0.3256 0.0749 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("and space out your practice; and you will learn to condense key ideas so you" 0.1177 0.8541 0.8247 0.8412 0.8412 0.0165 0.00588 0.2721 0.0341 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("can hold them more easily in your mind. Master the simple, practical" 0.1177 0.7807 0.8465 0.8630 0.8630 0.0165 0.00588 0.3637 0.0329 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("approaches outlined here and you will be able to learn more effectively and" 0.1177 0.8459 0.8683 0.8848 0.8848 0.0165 0.00588 0.2829 0.1091 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("with less frustration. This wonderful guide will enrich both your learning and" 0.1177 0.8671 0.8901 0.9066 0.9066 0.0165 0.00588 0.3026 0.0412 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0))
  (12
  ("your life." 0.1177 0.2082 0.0956 0.1121 0.1121 0.0165 0.00588 0.2500 0.0443 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("—Terrence J. Sejnowski, Francis Crick Professor, Salk Institute for Biological" 0.1365 0.8818 0.1465 0.1630 0.1630 0.0165 0.00588 0.2964 0.1034 "AAAAAB+LiberationSerif-Italic" 0.0182 nil t 0)
