  ("I’ve written this book to lay out these simple techniques so that you can" 0.1577 0.8412 0.3447 0.3612 0.3612 0.0165 0.00588 0.3176 0.0375 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("immediately begin using them. What takes years for practitioners to discover" 0.1177 0.8596 0.3665 0.3830 0.3830 0.0165 0.00588 0.3490 0.1200 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("is now at your fingertips." 0.1177 0.3612 0.3883 0.4048 0.4048 0.0165 0.00588 0.3050 0.0162 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("Using these approaches, no matter what your skill levels in math and" 0.1577 0.8188 0.4101 0.4266 0.4266 0.0165 0.00588 0.3256 0.0565 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("science, you can change your thinking and change your life. If you’re already" 0.1177 0.8659 0.4320 0.4485 0.4485 0.0165 0.00588 0.2544 0.0765 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
