  ("If you’ve ever wanted to become better at anything, this book will help serve as" 0.1177 0.8797 0.5628 0.5794 0.5794 0.0165 0.00588 0.3121 0.0149 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
