  ("This book is for high school students who love art and English classes but" 0.1577 0.8736 0.6065 0.6230 0.6230 0.0165 0.00588 0.2855 0.0433 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("loathe math. It is meant as well as for college students who already excel in" 0.1177 0.8400 0.6283 0.6448 0.6448 0.0165 0.00588 0.3353 0.0587 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
