  ("either falling off the math track or trying to rocket toward math and science" 0.1177 0.8469 0.6938 0.7103 0.7103 0.0165 0.00588 0.3250 0.0537 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("stardom. It’s for the frazzled nine-to-five worker who hasn’t been able to pass" 0.1177 0.8668 0.7156 0.7321 0.7321 0.0165 0.00588 0.3040 0.0847 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("an important certification test, and for the night-shift convenience store clerk" 0.1177 0.8588 0.7374 0.7539 0.7539 0.0165 0.00588 0.2918 0.0223 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("who has dreamed of becoming a nurse—or even a doctor. It’s for the growing" 0.1177 0.8706 0.7592 0.7758 0.7758 0.0165 0.00588 0.3455 0.0400 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
  ("army of homeschoolers. It’s for teachers and professors—not only in math," 0.1177 0.8471 0.7810 0.7976 0.7976 0.0165 0.00588 0.3435 0.0506 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0)
