  ("Now, I realize that my problem was rooted in two distinctly different modes" 0.1177 0.8480 0.8901 0.9066 0.9066 0.0165 0.00588 0.3581 0.0506 "AAAAAA+LiberationSerif" 0.0182 nil nil 0))))
